==MWStake Meeting Creation==
Steps to create a new MWStake meeting:
# Sign into MWStake (if you don't have an account, contact [[User:Mark Hershberger|Mark]])
# On the sidebar, click the Event icon with the "+"
# Select the Start/Stop Date/Time
#* {{Note|Currently the date picker isn't working on this site, but Mark has an [[Action:4|action to fix it]].  It should be in the form: <code>2019/09/06</code> }}
#* {{Note|Traditionally we've been meeting at 15:30 UTC during standard time and 16:30 UTC (8:30am PST, 11:30am EST, 5:30pm CET) during daylight saving time.}}
# Enter the meeting URL
#* {{Note|Currently we're using [[User:Bryandamon|Bryan's]] Google Hangout which can handle up to 25 attendees: <code><nowiki>https://meet.google.com/mdd-ufhn-ksb</nowiki></code>}}
# Add a "Meeting Agenda" header, see [[Event:92|any previous meeting for format]] (this could be built into the Event template)
#: {{Note|The URL for the Etherpad is now created by the Form/Template.}}
# Add an "Action board" header with the following (this could be built into the Event template):
#: <SyntaxHighlight lang="linux-config">
{{Actionable board
|Open
|{{PAGENAME}}
|Extension, Conference
|True
|View
|{{PAGENAME}}
}}</SyntaxHighlight>

