* https://phabricator.wikimedia.org/T140068

Interesting articles and sites on open source:
* [https://motherboard.vice.com/en_us/article/43zak3/the-internet-was-built-on-the-free-labor-of-open-source-developers-is-that-sustainable The Internet Was Built on the Free Labor of Open Source Developers. Is That Sustainable?] - MotherBoard
* [https://www.codeshelter.co/ Code Shelter] is a collective of volunteer software developers that aims to help with maintaining popular open source projects whose authors need a hand or don't have the time to maintain them any more.

