==Meeting overview==
# '''Wait for attendees & chat''' {{Agenda time|5 min}}
# '''Wiki Moment''' {{Agenda time|5 min}} {{Agenda presenter|Bryan}}
#* Brief discussion to customizing and adding tooltips to the sidebar menu
# '''Intro to new meeting structure''' {{Agenda time|5 min}} {{Agenda presenter|Bryan}}
#* Discuss new '''MWStake''' meeting format and rationale (more useful to participants & more structured)
#* Evita will be structuring the meetings, send her topics, discuss where to add ideas and comments (including now in chat)
# '''EMWCon 2019 Recap''' {{Agenda time|5 min}} {{Agenda presenter|Unknown}}
#* Highlights for those that missed it
# '''SMWCon 2019 Update and Planning''' {{Agenda time|5 min}} {{Agenda presenter|Lex}}
#* Regarding MWStake's upcoming '''SMWCon Fall 2019''' organizational role we schedule a '''brief coordination meeting right after''' this regular MWStake monthly meeting, i.e. at '''16:30 UTC'''. Please see/add_to '''https://manage.mwstake.org/wiki/C1237859930#Agenda'''.
# '''MWStake Bylaws & Incorporation Update''' {{Agenda time|5 min}} {{Agenda presenter|Mark}}
#* Generally the bylaws have been approved
#* Next steps
# '''Membership Dues''' {{Agenda time|10 min}} {{Agenda presenter|Mark}}
#* Feedback on [[Bylaws/Dues|current structure]] on the [[Talk:Bylaws/Dues|talk page]]
# '''Duplicator Task''' {{Agenda time|10 min}} {{Agenda presenter|Mark}} {{Agenda presenter|Rich}} {{Agenda presenter|Lex}}
#* This was discussed during EMWCon 2019
#* Stewardship of an extension
#* First task to understand how the group can work together to accomplish a goal
#* This can provide a framework for future stewardship of a "suite" of MWStake currated extensions for enterprise use

