==Requirements==
# Provide a detailed narrative description of all the activities of the organization—past, present, and planned. 
# List each activity separately in the order of importance based on the relative time and other resources devoted to the activity. 
# Indicate the percentage of time for each activity. 
# Each description should include, as a minimum, the following: 
#:# Detailed description of the activity including its purpose and how each activity furthers your exempt purpose; 
#:# When the activity was or will be initiated; and 
#:# Where and by whom the activity will be conducted.
#* {{Font color|blue|Contribute to the development of MediaWiki}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Maintain MediaWiki and its extensions}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Improve documentation for MediaWiki and its extensions}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Cooperate and liaison with the Wikimedia Foundation, Inc.}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Coordinate between MediaWiki developers, operators, and users}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Promote MediaWiki to the public}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Act as a patron and coordinator for international gatherings, conferences, hackathons, etc.}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Advocate on behalf of third-party users of MediaWiki}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Foster best practices for MediaWiki and its users}}
# List the organization’s present and future sources of financial support, beginning with the largest source first
#:* {{Font color|blue|Wikimedia Foundation}}
#:* {{Font color|blue|Personal contributions by the current president for WikiApiary hosting}}
#:* {{Font color|blue|Member dues (Individual & Corporate)}}
#:* {{Font color|blue|Conference attendee ticket sales}}
# Information about the organization’s governing body:
#:# Names, addresses, and titles of officers, directors, trustees and Annual compensation (if any)
#* {{Font color|blue|Mark Hershberger — President}}
#* {{Font color|blue|James Montalvo — Vice President}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Evita Hollis — Treasurer}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Bryan Hilderbrand — Secretary}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Cindy Cicalese}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Lex Sulzer}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Markus Glaser}}
#* {{Font color|blue|Sabine Melnicki}}
#:: {{Note|No compensation for officers/directors, addresses will be provided separately.}}
# If now, or plan to be, connected in any way with any other organization, describe the other organization and explain the relationship (for example, financial support on a continuing basis; shared facilities or employees; same officers, directors, or trustees).
#:* {{Font color|blue|Wikimedia Foundation, financial support via grants}}
# Qualifications necessary for membership in the organization; the classes of membership (with the number of members in each class); and the voting rights and privileges received. 
#:* {{Font color|blue|No required qualifications.  Expectation of experience with and familiarity of MediaWiki}}
# If any group or class of persons is required to join, describe the requirement and explain the relationship between those members and members who join voluntarily. Submit copies of any membership solicitation material. Attach sample copies of all types of membership certificates issued.
#:* {{Font color|blue|"required to join"? No one.}}
# Does, or will, any part of your organization’s receipts represent payments for services performed or to be performed?   If yes state in detail the amount received and the character of the services performed or to be performed.
#:* {{Font color|blue|Maybe?}}
# Has the organization made, or does it plan to make, any payments to members or shareholders for services performed or to be performed? If yes state in detail the amount paid, the character of the services, and to whom the payments have been, or will be, made.
#:* {{Font color|blue|Maybe?}}
# Has the organization spent or does it plan to spend any money attempting to influence the selection, nomination, election, or appointment of any person to any federal, state, or local public office or to an office in a political organization?  If yes explain in detail and list the amounts spent or to be spent in each case
#:* {{Font color|blue|No}}
# Provide Any published pamphlets, brochures, newsletters, journals, or similar printed material regarding the organization.
#:* {{Font color|blue|https://mwstake.org}}

