==Meeting agenda== # '''Wait for attendees & chat''' {{Agenda time|5 min}} # '''Loan for EMWCon (i.e. financing the conference)''' {{Agenda time|30 min}} # '''What are the requirements for Board Members (i.e. Board member attendance of monthly meetings)''' {{Agenda time|10 min}} # '''How are future Board Members chosen?''' {{Agenda time|5 min}} # <del>Discuss "Pay-For-Service" {{Agenda time|5 min}}</del> Moved to next meeting due to time # '''Update on Incorporation''' {{Agenda time|5 min}}
==Notes== '''[https://etherpad.wikimedia.org/p/mwstake-board-11-19 Etherpad Notes]'''
# '''Loan for EMWCon (i.e. financing the conference)''' #* {{Agenda presenter|Lex}} Just have an account and send money ($500) from (10) people. #* {{Agenda presenter|Markus}} It's actually more difficult than you'd expect to transfer money. #* {{Agenda presenter|Bryan}} As a quick status update, mwstake is incorporated but haven't completed the non-profit filing with the IRS. We do have an a bank account and we can turn on "merchant services" at any time which would allow us to collect money from anywhere in the world. We are hoping to give access to both Mark and Evita (Treasurer) before we set-up merchant services because it'll be harder to do after. #* {{Agenda presenter|Cindy}} What about just early registration? #* {{Agenda presenter|Cindy}} We could start collecting membership now. #** {{Agenda presenter|Lex}} What is the "quid pro quo" #* {{Agenda presenter|Bryan}} It seems we have 3 options: #*# "Founders" 10 people @ $500 (or some ratio) #*# "Early Registration" #*# "Collect Membership now" (Could be prepaid for the next XX years?)
#* {{Action}} {{Agenda presenter|Mark}}
