ity, why should we send anyone in-person #* (Bernhard) Maybe different costs base on in-person vs. remote attendance? #* (Cindy) The remote portion functionally doesn't have a cost and we don't want to deter possible attendees #* (Yeroen) Prefer if online is free. It's a form of marketing. #* (Bryan) We should coordinate all the social media platforms between SMW, EMW, and others. #** SMW has a [https://www.semantic-mediawiki.org/wiki/semantic-mediawiki.org:Services_accounts defined page] for who controls each platform # '''Discussion about blogs / blogging platforms''' #* [https://river.me/ Megan (River's) blog] using the [https://gohugo.io/ Hugo platform] #* (Bernhard) Blogs should be SMW powered. # '''Composer RFC''' #* [[Request for Comment/Hybrid extension management]] #* (Cindy) There is a need for a best practices page (e.g. Never use Composer to enable an extension, extension.JSON should load them)
