'''Description''':<br>
Yaron's [[{{FULLPAGENAME}}/Original email (07DEC)|original email]] lays it out nicely, but the projects seems to have 3 main parts (which seem to be independent and can be worked on in parallel):
* '''Platform''' (Meza, Sunflower Distribution, Docker approach, some combination, something entirely new)
* '''Transfer''' (PX, Wikibase method, MABS, other)
* '''Content''' (Actual Product/Package/Module/etc.)

