==Notes== The meeting voice transcription is available on the [[Event_talk:{{PAGENAME}}|talk page]]. # '''Help Desk''' #* (Mark) Thanked Brian Wolff for his support desk help # '''This month in MediaWiki''' (Mark) - Based off [https://etherpad.wikimedia.org/p/mwstake-2020-09 Etherpad notes] #* MW Logo Change # '''New Flex Diagrams extension''' #* [[MW:Extension:Flex Diagrams|Flex Diagrams]] extension from Yaron #* Offers support for BPMN, Gantt, and Mermaid. Editable examples below: #** [https://discoursedb.org/w/index.php?title=BPMN:Hi&action=editdiagram BPMN] #** [https://discoursedb.org/w/index.php?title=Gantt:Project_ATLAS&action=editdiagram Gantt] #** [https://discoursedb.org/w/index.php?title=Mermaid:Sample_diagram&action=editdiagram Mermaid]
