==Notes== # '''MediaWiki News''' {{Agenda presenter|Gergo}} #* Proposal to make shelling out from MediaWiki containerizable: https://phabricator.wikimedia.org/T260330 #* Firefox required version upped to 3.6: https://phabricator.wikimedia.org/T262946 #* A bunch more requirement changes are being discussed: https://phabricator.wikimedia.org/T266866 #* RfC for a more formalized way to provide config snippets, mainly for testing: https://phabricator.wikimedia.org/T267928 #* Old RfCs still being discussed: extension Composer compatibility, DB upgrade support for old versions #* Wikimedia Movement Strategy Global Conversations: https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/Strategy/Wikimedia_movement/2018-20/Transition/Global_Conversations # '''SMWCon''' #* [https://www.semantic-mediawiki.org/wiki/SMWCon_Fall_2020 SMWCon Page] #* Many thanks to Bernhard Krabina, Richard Heigl, and others that put it together, it was a great sucess #* Not all the talks are out yet, but here is the [https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLw2YgbWET_pgT_oUsampBL8O6osinnNW8 YouTube playlist] # '''Community Wishlist Survey 2021''' #* [https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/Community_Wishlist_Survey_2021 link to survey] # '''WMF Stable Interface Policy''' # '''Creating reusable MediaWiki products''' # '''How to become a member''' # '''WikiConference North America (WCNA) # '''Chat service recommendation'''
