{{Event |mwstake-meeting=No |title=Board Meeting |start-date=2021/02/04 |start-hour=03 |start-minute=30 |end-date=2021/02/04 |end-hour=04 |end-minute=30 |attendees=Bryan Hildebrand, Cindy Cicalese, Eric-Jan, Evita Hollis, Lex Sulzer, Mark Hershberger, Markus Glaser }} ==Agenda== # MWStake.org and WikiApiary.org hosting # Code of Conduct # Conference Platforms
==Notes== The meeting voice transcription is available on the [[Event_talk:{{PAGENAME}}|talk page]]. # '''MWStake.org and WikiApiary.org hosting''' #* {{Agenda presenter|Mark}} Bryan Davis mentioned we need to get of WMF hosted sites for MWStake.org and WikiApiary.org hosting #** The need is due to Static IP addresses, not necessarily banddwith or hosting costs #* {{Agenda presenter|Bryan}} I just want to make sure we're financially secure before committing to this #** For example, we should have enough in the bank to cover a few months hosting costs & have enough members to pay a percentage of the fees #* {{Agenda presenter|Mark}} OK, we should have a goal of X months of "liquidity" #** Let's shoot for 6 months #** Goal of taking over hosting in 2 months # '''Code of Conduct (CoC)''' #* {{Agenda presenter|Cindy}} Amir Sarabadani was the contact used to start the CoC #** Finding out how they handle issues (anonymous reporting, etc.) #* There are some legal issues #** We should have our processes reviewed by WMF legal #* We are following their (WMF) rules & processes as close as possible (but don't have a legal team ourselves) # '''Conference Platforms''' #* Some options include: #*# [https://zoom.us/ Zoom] #*# [https://hopin.com/ Hopin] #*# [https://www.wonder.me/ Wonder] #*# [https://gather.town/ Gather Town] #*# [https://miro.com/ Miro] #*# [https://bigbluebutton.org/ BigBlueButton] #*# [https://remo.co/remo-101/ Remo] #*# [https://www.airmeet.com/ Airmeet] #* We will be testing some out in the next few weeks # '''MWStake Machinery''' #* Markus & Bryan to discuss what is required for MWStake (Annual Meetings, etc.) at the next board meeting
